      "text": " 3,640 plus 91, which equals 3,731.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Break down the numbers:**\n   - 41 can be broken down into 40 and 1.\n\n2. **Multiply 91 by 40:**\n   - 91 \u00d7 40 = 3,640\n\n3. **Multiply 91 by 1:**\n   - 91 \u00d7 1 = 91\n\n4. **Add the results:**\n   - 3,640 + 91 = 3,731\n\n**Final Answer:**\nThe product of 91 and 41 is 3,731.\n\n\\boxed{3731}",
      "logprobs": null,
      "finish_reason": "stop",
